                <pb facs="1592" n="1434" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1434"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Russell</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-02-07"><hi rendition="#italic">February 7,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Root states that the embassy at Paris has been cabled to instruct consuls to
                    take charge of archives of Venezuelan consulates, if agreeable to the Government
                    of France.)</p>
            </div>
